ed}\n$$\n\nFirst, we differentiate $g(x).$ We express $g(x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(12-2x)$ as the composite function\n\n$$\ng=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u,\\,u=12-2x.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}g}{\\text{d}u}=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡u,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}g}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}g}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡u \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(12-2x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we differentiate $h(x)=-6{x}^{3}.$ \n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}h}{\\text{d}x}=-18{x}^{2}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n{f}^{′}(x)={g}^{′}(x)+{h}^{′}(x)=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(12-2x)-18{x}^{2}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["0908c732-21de-5c29-bd3c-fcc27be47e16"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "e306351b-f7b2-5a3a-a137-067728da4a2d" :answer/id #uuid "e306351b-f7b2-5a3a-a137-067728da4a2d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=x - 13 - \\pi" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f8e39cff-3a0b-561b-aed8-6264adb9a14b" :answer/id #uuid "f8e39cff-3a0b-561b-aed8-6264adb9a14b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=x - 12 + \\pi" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e6f5eaf7-7a98-5396-8b85-e5a1ae4f1cf7" :answer/id #uuid "e6f5eaf7-7a98-5396-8b85-e5a1ae4f1cf7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=-12" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8609c4ba-b913-512c-b515-0998e93e7785" :answer/id #uuid "8609c4ba-b913-512c-b515-0998e93e7785" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=- 12 x + 12 \\pi" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6c21bebd-faa9-5e47-86d5-105935cf93a9" :answer/id #uuid "6c21bebd-faa9-5e47-86d5-105935cf93a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y=0" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fffaf1e8-370e-5f04-8dfc-a0db9cc43904" :answer-field/id #uuid "fffaf1e8-370e-5f04-